### Uji endpoint (pakai ekstensi VS Code "REST Client", atau salin ke Postman/Thunder Client)
@base = http://localhost:3000/jasa

### 1. READ semua jasa
GET {{base}}

### 2. CREATE jasa baru
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Jasa Foto Produk",
  "kategori": "Fotografi",
  "deskripsi": "10 foto produk + edit",
  "harga": 200000,
  "penyedia": "Ejenia Studio",
  "rating": 4.9
}

### 3. READ satu jasa
GET {{base}}/1

### 4. UPDATE jasa
PATCH {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "harga": 175000,
  "tersedia": false
}

### 5. DELETE jasa
DELETE {{base}}/10

### 6. Validasi gagal (harus 400 Bad Request)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "",
  "harga": -1
}

### 7. (OPSIONAL) Filter dengan where
GET {{base}}/cari?kategori=desain&tersedia=true&maxHarga=300000

### 8. (OPSIONAL) Statistik dengan count / aggregate / groupBy
GET {{base}}/statistik
